SUMMARY:Zach & Viggo: Thunderflop LIVE at The Bell House
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nZach & Viggo: Thunderflop\nThe world’s greatest Norwegian-American comedy duo returns for a special one-off performance of their internationally-acclaimed show for the first time in nearly 7 years! Award-winning clowns Zach Zucker (Stamptown\, Jack Tucker) and Viggo Venn (Britain’s Got Talent Winner) have done it all — from NBA Halftime Shows to The Royal Variety Show\, Off-Broadway and on The West End. Now\, come see the show that launched their careers at The Bell House! \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, July 6\, 2026\nDoor Time: 7:00 PM | Show Time: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Bell House\, 149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nSeating:\n\nAbout Zach Zucker & Viggo Venn\nZach Zucker is the creator and host of Stamptown\, the acclaimed alternative comedy variety show. Viggo Venn is the winner of Britain’s Got Talent 2023\, known for his high-energy clown performances. Together\, they are an unstoppable force of comedic chaos. \nWhat to Expect\nA rare\, one-night-only reunion of two of the world’s most exciting comedy performers. Thunderflop is the show that launched their careers — expect wild\, physical\, and brilliantly funny comedy unlike anything else. \nVenue Information\nThe Bell House149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215By Subway: Take the F\, G or R Train to the Smith-9th Streets station. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $35–$58. There is an 8-ticket limit per order. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nDisclaimer: This post contains affiliate links. Purchasing tickets through our links helps support this site at no additional cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/zach-viggo-thunderflop-live-at-the-bell-house/
LOCATION:The Bell House\, 149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY\, 11215\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/6c2a9d7e-0193-473f-9b6b-e736cdb71691_RETINA_LANDSCAPE_16_9-QAeoZ4.jpg
GEO:40.6737398;-73.9916854
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Bell House 149 7th Street Brooklyn NY 11215 USA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=149 7th Street:geo:-73.9916854,40.6737398
END:VEVENT
