SUMMARY:Tommy Davidson LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nTommy Davidson is a comedy legend whose career spans over three decades of making audiences laugh across television\, film\, and the stand-up stage. Best known as one of the original cast members of the groundbreaking sketch comedy series In Living Color\, Tommy’s versatility\, energy\, and comedic genius have made him one of the most beloved entertainers of his generation. \nTommy’s film credits include Ace Ventura: Pet Detective\, Booty Call\, Bamboozled\, and Juwanna Mann. He has also appeared in numerous television shows and has released multiple stand-up specials that showcase his incredible range as a performer. \nKnown for his physical comedy\, impressions\, and ability to find humor in everyday life\, Tommy Davidson delivers a show that is both nostalgic and fresh. His performances are a masterclass in comedic timing and audience connection. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, July 7\, 2026 \nShow Time: 7:00 PM HST (Doors open at 5:00 PM) \nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Ave\, Honolulu\, HI 96815 \nClub Policy: $20 food or beverage minimum per person. Seating is first come\, first served. Full bar and full dinner menu available. \nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s most celebrated intimate live entertainment venue\, nestled inside the Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort at 2335 Kalakaua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. The venue is renowned for its world-class acoustics\, intimate atmosphere\, and exceptional dining and bar service. \nWith seating options ranging from Premium Seating to Loge Seating & Bar Area\, every guest enjoys an up-close experience with the performer. The venue’s warm\, sophisticated ambiance makes it the perfect setting for a special night out in Waikiki. \nBlue Note Hawaii is located steps from Waikiki Beach\, making it easy to combine a comedy show with a beautiful Hawaiian evening. Parking is available at the Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort and nearby public parking structures. \nWhat to Expect\nTommy Davidson’s show at Blue Note Hawaii is a one-night-only event that comedy fans in Honolulu won’t want to miss. The intimate setting of Blue Note Hawaii provides the perfect backdrop for Tommy’s high-energy\, physically expressive comedy style. \nExpect a full headline set featuring Tommy’s signature impressions\, physical comedy\, and personal storytelling. Having performed for decades\, Tommy knows how to read a room and deliver a performance that feels both polished and spontaneous. \nThis is a rare opportunity to see a true comedy legend up close in one of Honolulu’s most intimate and prestigious venues. Tickets are limited and expected to sell out quickly. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $141 (resale market) \nSecure your seats now through the official ticket link or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tommy-davidson-live-at-blue-note-hawaii/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/12/76/62/14_Edp.jpg?v=7
