SUMMARY:Rondell Sheridan LIVE at Brad Garrett's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nRondell Sheridan LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughs as Rondell Sheridan takes the stage at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside the MGM Grand in Las Vegas. Known for his sharp wit and high-energy performances\, Rondell Sheridan delivers a stand-up experience you won’t want to miss. Joining him is comedian Matt Kirshen for an unforgettable evening of comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, July 7\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Must be 18 or over to attend)\nParking: Available at MGM Grand (fees may apply) \nAbout Rondell Sheridan\nRondell Sheridan is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor best known for his role as Victor Baxter on the hit Disney Channel series That’s So Raven. With decades of experience in stand-up comedy\, Sheridan has performed at clubs and theaters across the country\, earning a reputation for his relatable humor and infectious energy. His comedy blends observational wit with personal storytelling that resonates with audiences of all ages. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a seasoned veteran\nHilarious observational humor and personal stories\nSpecial performance by comedian Matt Kirshen\nIntimate comedy club atmosphere at the MGM Grand\n18+ show with adult content\nBest available seating within purchased zone\n\nVenue Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand Hotel and Casino on the Las Vegas Strip. The club offers an intimate setting with top-tier comedians performing nightly. Seating is best available within the zone purchased and is not assigned in advance. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $111. There is an overall 8 ticket limit for this event. All performers are subject to change without notice. Seats are NOT assigned — seating is best available within the zone purchased upon arrival. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
